{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Boot-time init (timer-fired once at start, like security.security.init). Two duties: (1) seeds runtime/metaidentity with the platform default identity (\"Some Dev\") when absent, so publishapp works on a fresh clone; (2) git self-registration - having git IS enabling git: registers the working checkout (named after its directory) and every repositories/* clone not already in the dev.git registry, all alike as ordinary repos (role library, autocommit on). Additive only, matched by canonical path, so hand-tuned entries are never clobbered; without git on PATH or without .git dirs it is a clean no-op and a zip install never notices.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;","params":[],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"ioyipx19feee23f1bq1","readers":[],"time":1794309683250,"username":"system","writers":[]}